    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>BOXO Return is een universeel retoursysteem voor herbruikbare verzendverpakkingen in Nederland.<br />\nMet deze app bied je klanten de optie voor een herbruikbare verzendverpakking in de checkout. Wanneer je klant hiervoor kiest wordt statiegeld toegevoegd in de winkelmand. Deze ontvangt de klant direct terug na inlevering van de verpakking bij een van de inleverpunten door heel Nederland.</p>\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"750\" height=\"422\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/GtcnjOF2N08?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en-US&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n",
        "faq": "<p>Op onze website vind je een overzicht met de meest gestelde vragen: <a href=\"https://www.boxo.nu/zakelijk/service\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">www.boxo.nu/zakelijk/service</a></p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>0.0.64</h4>\n<p>Support older PHP versions.</p>\n<h4>0.0.63</h4>\n<p>Support custom checkouts where the checkout form has been modified.</p>\n<h4>0.0.62</h4>\n<p>Bump &#8220;Tested up to&#8221; to 6.8.3.</p>\n<h4>0.0.61</h4>\n<p>Improve checkout performance and theme support.</p>\n<h4>0.0.60</h4>\n<p>Remove packaging selection requirement in checkout, which was made redundant by default selection.</p>\n<h4>0.0.58</h4>\n<p>Improve checkout performance.</p>\n<h4>0.0.57</h4>\n<p>Improve tooltip position.</p>\n<h4>0.0.53</h4>\n<p>Remove option to change packaging picker position.</p>\n<h4>0.0.51</h4>\n<p>Allow Shop Manager role to edit Boxo Return settings.</p>\n<h4>0.0.49</h4>\n<p>Add option to change packaging picker position.</p>\n<h4>0.0.48</h4>\n<p>Improve packaging picker text.</p>\n<h4>0.0.46</h4>\n<p>Improve product picker.</p>\n<h4>0.0.45</h4>\n<p>Fix product picker bug.</p>\n<h4>0.0.44</h4>\n<p>Allow Shop Manager role to access settings page.</p>\n<h4>0.0.36</h4>\n<p>Disposable fee is including tax.</p>\n<h4>0.0.35</h4>\n<p>Improve product search on settings page.</p>\n<h4>0.0.34</h4>\n<p>Show packaging column in order list.</p>\n<h4>0.0.33</h4>\n<p>Show packaging in order preview.</p>\n<h4>0.0.32</h4>\n<p>Add optional cart limit.</p>\n<h4>0.0.31</h4>\n<p>Fix allowed products.</p>\n<h4>0.0.29</h4>\n<p>Add Dutch translations to settings page.</p>\n<h4>0.0.28</h4>\n<p>Add instructions to settings page.</p>\n<h4>0.0.27</h4>\n<p>Add option to always use reusable packaging when possible, instead of showing a selection menu at checkout.</p>\n<h4>0.0.26</h4>\n<p>Update tax settings for deposit (not taxable) and disposable packaging fee (taxable).</p>\n<h4>0.0.25</h4>\n<p>Add default packaging setting.</p>\n<h4>0.0.23</h4>\n<p>Add optional fee for disposable packaging.</p>\n<h4>0.0.22</h4>\n<p>Add allowed products configuration.</p>\n<h4>0.0.15</h4>\n<p>Add info icon with customizable URL in checkout.</p>\n<h4>0.0.1</h4>\n<p>First version.</p>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "BOXO Return biedt klanten de optie voor een herbruikbare verzendverpakking.",
